Subject: [PATCH 06/12] ps4: platform services and launcher

Open VideoOut early, set HOME/KODI_HOME, load the network sysmodules, raise the thread stack size, configure the Python runtime and bundled CA bundle, and add the PS4 app launcher builtin.
